    <data key="d0">Sisense Analytics Architecture on AWS</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SxFag4CMWU8</data>
    <data key="d2">Sisense's hybrid big data analytics architecture ingests data from disparate sources into EKS containerized workloads, utilizing FSx for Lustre for fast hot-data processing backed by S3, and Redshift for large-scale warm data querying.</data>
    <data key="d3">analytics</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
